    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "IDHO3WQvjrgJ",
        "outputId": "fff5f55b-809c-4086-90c0-066786305a22"
      },
      "source": [
        "# ---- Cohen's d (manual, with effsize cross-check) ----------------------\n",
        "n1 <- length(mass_f)\n",
        "n2 <- length(mass_m)\n",
        "\n",
        "s_pool   <- sqrt(((n1 - 1) * var(mass_f) + (n2 - 1) * var(mass_m)) / (n1 + n2 - 2))\n",
        "d_manual <- (mean(mass_f) - mean(mass_m)) / s_pool\n",
        "\n",
        "cat(\"Cohen's d (female - male) =\", round(d_manual, 4), \"\\n\")\n",
        "\n",
        "ad  <- abs(d_manual)\n",
        "mag <- if (ad < 0.2) {\n",
        "  \"negligible\"\n",
        "} else if (ad < 0.5) {\n",
        "  \"small\"\n",
        "} else if (ad < 0.8) {\n",
        "  \"medium\"\n",
        "} else {\n",
        "  \"large\"\n",
        "}\n",
        "\n",
        "cat(\"Magnitude by Cohen's conventions:\", mag, \"\\n\\n\")\n",
        "\n",
        "if (HAS_EFF) {\n",
        "  cat(\"--- effsize::cohen.d cross-check ---\\n\")\n",
        "  print(effsize::cohen.d(peng$body_mass_g, peng$sex))\n",
        "}"
      ],
      "execution_count": 13,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "Cohen's d (female - male) = -0.9362 \n",
            "Magnitude by Cohen's conventions: large \n",
            "\n",
            "--- effsize::cohen.d cross-check ---\n",
            "\n",
            "Cohen's d\n",
            "\n",
            "d estimate: -0.9362048 (large)\n",
            "95 percent confidence interval:\n",
            "     lower      upper \n",
            "-1.1633158 -0.7090938 \n",
            "\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "kXfL8xQZjrgJ"
      },
      "source": [
        "### Interpretation — Section 2\n",
        "\n",
        "- **Normality.** Shapiro-Wilk rejects normality for **both** sexes (female W = 0.919, p = 6.2e-08; male W = 0.925, p = 1.2e-07) and the QQ-plots show mild S-curvature. With n = 165 (female) / 168 (male) the CLT makes the sampling distribution of the mean approximately normal, so the t-test stays valid.\n",
        "- **Variance.** Levene's test (F = 6.06, p = 0.014), Bartlett's (p = 0.032) and the F-test (p = 0.032) all indicate unequal variances (males more variable), so the **Welch** t-test is the correct choice, not Student's.\n",
        "- **p-value.** Welch t = −8.55, df ≈ 323.9, p = 4.8e-16 → reject $H_0$. Mean body mass differs significantly between sexes.\n",
        "- **Confidence interval.** Mean difference (female − male) = −683.4 g, 95% CI ≈ [−840.6, −526.3] g. It excludes zero, agreeing with the p-value: males average roughly 530–840 g heavier.\n",
        "- **Effect size.** Cohen's d ≈ −0.936 → large. The difference is biologically meaningful, not just statistically detectable — the expected sexual dimorphism in these species."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "markdown",
      "metadata": {
        "id": "kaydhZCEjrgJ"
      },
      "source": [
        "## 3. One-Way ANOVA — body mass across species\n",
        "\n",
        "- $H_0: \\mu_{\\text{Adelie}} = \\mu_{\\text{Chinstrap}} = \\mu_{\\text{Gentoo}}$\n",
        "- $H_1$: at least one species mean differs."
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
          "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
        },
        "id": "bIQVM7jXjrgJ",
        "outputId": "7721b0dc-c5b1-407c-8d8a-04ea7facae11"
      },
      "source": [
        "# ---- Assumption 1: normality within each species -----------------------\n",
        "for (s in levels(peng$species)) {\n",
        "  x <- peng$body_mass_g[peng$species == s]\n",
        "  cat(\"\\n--- Shapiro-Wilk:\", s, \"(n =\", length(x), \") ---\\n\")\n",
        "  print(shapiro.test(x))\n",
        "}"
      ],
      "execution_count": 14,
      "outputs": [
        {
          "output_type": "stream",
          "name": "stdout",
          "text": [
            "\n",
            "--- Shapiro-Wilk: Adelie (n = 146 ) ---\n",
            "\n",
            "\tShapiro-Wilk normality test\n",
            "\n",
            "data:  x\n",
            "W = 0.98116, p-value = 0.04232\n",
            "\n",
            "\n",
            "--- Shapiro-Wilk: Chinstrap (n = 68 ) ---\n",
            "\n",
            "\tShapiro-Wilk normality test\n",
            "\n",
            "data:  x\n",
            "W = 0.98449, p-value = 0.5605\n",
            "\n",
            "\n",
            "--- Shapiro-Wilk: Gentoo (n = 119 ) ---\n",
            "\n",
            "\tShapiro-Wilk normality test\n",
            "\n",
            "data:  x\n",
            "W = 0.98606, p-value = 0.2605\n",
            "\n"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cell_type": "code",
      "metadata": {
        "colab": {
